OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FHeavy and
OL,6,Fthundery showers are possible at times
OL,7,Fthrough the evening and overnight.
OL,8,FSurface water issues are possible. A
OL,9,Frelatively cool night for some rural
OL,10,Fspots.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FAny remaining heavy and
OL,13,Fthundery showers gradually clear to
OL,14,Fthe south of the region through the
OL,15,Fmorning, to leave a brighter
OL,16,Fafternoon, with just a few lighter
OL,17,Foutbreaks of rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
