OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:
OL,6,FTemperatures staying below average
OL,7,Finto the weekend. Isolated showers
OL,8,Fcontinuing on Friday, but becoming
OL,9,Fmore settled again heading into the
OL,10,Fweekend with an increasing number of
OL,11,Fsunny spells.
